s (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid 4986f0d9-5b23-5ff2-95d7-044d432c2c6e)) (text "GALVANIC BARRIER: U2 and U3.\nNo relay or auxiliary supply. Output remains hazardous when OFF." (at 210 245 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid ca5ced28-4cac-53ba-b9a2-cb2ae3875cfb)) (text "J1: 1=3V3, 2=GND, 3=SDA(GPIO6), 4=SCL(GPIO7). 3.3 V I2C slave.\nJP1 fitted: regulated external supply >=1 A; capacity must be confirmed. USB flashing: disconnect J1 and open JP1.\nGPIO3=ZC; GPIO4=FIRE; GPIO5 unused. FIRE must stay low at reset.\nFirmware: sync to 50 Hz, soft start, I2C timeout and loss of ZC => OFF." (at 20 221 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 749b9a73-3020-5ac6-9128-a32c6578c167)) (text "1000 W / 220 V = 4.55 A. Two-layer PCB, 70 um copper, main power tracks 4 mm.\nTO-220 necks 1.75 mm due to 2.54 mm lead pitch and 0.8 mm clearance.\nHeatsink <=4 C/W plus <=0.5 C/W interface, outside the SELV zone.\nFuse and MOV are PCB-mounted. No external thermal cutout.\nReflector PE: direct external certified connection, never logic GND." (at 20 246 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid b18d984f-3a85-5f11-8d46-3cc9ff64bf48)) (text "U2: random-phase MOC3052; do NOT use MOC3063.\nU3: pulse near zero; calibrate actual timing.\nR7+R8: 2x47k / 1W; 0.66 W total maximum at 242 Vac, R -5%.\nSee docs/ZERO_CROSS_CALCULATION.md for calculation and validation." (at 210 234 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 26422e62-eb3a-5b4b-95f3-0b06a8e91c02)) (embedded_fonts no))
